{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 15 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图神经网络：当边、拓扑和关系本身就是医学信息</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Graph &amp; Mesh Networks</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_076_gat-title\">GAT</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">对预定义邻域内的边计算 masked multi-head attention，再以数据依赖权重聚合邻居特征。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Replaces fixed degree-normalized edge weights with content-dependent multi-head masked self-attention coefficients α_{ij} computed over 1-hop graph neighborhoods.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">图 G=(V,E) 与节点特征 X</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Graph G=(V,E) and node feature vectors {h_i}</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">注意力聚合后的节点或图级预测</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Anisotropically aggregated node representations h'_i and attention edge weights α_{ij}</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1710.10903\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_076_gat')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_076_gat')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"GAT original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/0a6f3f7618a2de03683d.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_076_gat', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_076_gat\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_076_gat')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_076_gat', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_076_gat\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">节点与边</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">预定义邻域 N(i) 限制可注意的节点对</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests graph g=(v,e) and node feature vectors {h_i} and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"预定义邻域 N(i) 限制可注意的节点对\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests graph g=(v,e) and node feature vectors {h_i} and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"节点与边\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_076_gat', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">节点与边</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预定义邻域 N(i) 限制可注意的节点对</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests graph g=(v,e) and node feature vectors {h_i} and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"共享 W 将 h_i、h_j 映射到 attention 空间\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes feature projection to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"特征投影\" data-node-name-en=\"feature projection\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_076_gat', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">特征投影</span><span class=\"lang-en\">feature projection</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">共享 W 将 h_i、h_j 映射到 attention 空间</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes feature projection to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"LeakyReLU(a^T[Wh_i || Wh_j]) 计算相邻节点兼容性\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Edge Attention Logits e_ij within the core masked graph attention computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"边注意力 e_ij\" data-node-name-en=\"Edge Attention Logits e_ij\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_076_gat', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">边注意力 e_ij</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Edge Attention Logits e_ij</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">LeakyReLU(a^T[Wh_i || Wh_j]) 计算相邻节点兼容性</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Edge Attention Logits e_ij within the core masked graph attention computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"仅在 j∈N(i) 上归一化得到 alpha_ij\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Neighborhood Softmax within the core masked graph attention computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"邻域 Softmax\" data-node-name-en=\"Neighborhood Softmax\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_076_gat', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">邻域 Softmax</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Neighborhood Softmax</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">仅在 j∈N(i) 上归一化得到 alpha_ij</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Neighborhood Softmax within the core masked graph attention computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"各 head 独立加权求和 Σ_j alpha_ij W h_j\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs aggregation within the core masked graph attention computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"多头聚合\" data-node-name-en=\"aggregation\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_076_gat', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多头聚合</span><span class=\"lang-en\">aggregation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">各 head 独立加权求和 Σ_j alpha_ij W h_j</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs aggregation within the core masked graph attention computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"中间层拼接多头，最终层可平均以稳定预测\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Concat within the core masked graph attention computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Concat / 平均\" data-node-name-en=\"Concat\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_076_gat', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Concat / 平均</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Concat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">中间层拼接多头，最终层可平均以稳定预测</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Concat within the core masked graph attention computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"激活后进入下一层，扩大多跳上下文\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 07 within the core masked graph attention computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"图层堆叠\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 07\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_076_gat', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">图层堆叠</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 07</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">激活后进入下一层，扩大多跳上下文</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 07 within the core masked graph attention computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"节点头或图 pooling/head\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Stage 08 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"任务读出\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 08\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_076_gat', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">任务读出</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 08</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">节点头或图 pooling/head</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Stage 08 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"节点、边或图级输出\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces anisotropically aggregated node representations h'_i and attention edge weights α_{ij} via prediction.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"预测\" data-node-name-en=\"prediction\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_076_gat', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">预测</span><span class=\"lang-en\">prediction</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">节点、边或图级输出</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces anisotropically aggregated node representations h'_i and attention edge weights α_{ij} via prediction.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"GAT Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 邻域掩码注意力与加权消息聚合</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Neighborhood-Masked LeakyReLU Attention Coefficients &amp; Multi-Head Message Aggregation</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"GAT：核心公式 · 邻域掩码注意力与加权消息聚合\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"76\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"34.695945pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.554081 -68.957464 361.714921 34.695945\" width=\"361.714921pt\" xmlns=\"http://ww