><use x=\"179.642166\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g10-186\" y=\"-42.241618\"></use><use x=\"184.653333\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g16-150\" y=\"-49.075975\"></use><use x=\"199.235265\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g16-17\" y=\"-49.075975\"></use><use x=\"204.452197\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g7-48\" y=\"-53.190535\"></use><use x=\"204.415833\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g13-56\" y=\"-46.351648\"></use><use x=\"210.303103\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g1-61\" y=\"-49.075975\"></use><use x=\"219.536181\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g16-102\" y=\"-49.075975\"></use><use x=\"226.669437\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g4-169\" y=\"-54.625157\"></use><use x=\"226.669437\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g4-173\" y=\"-48.647573\"></use><use x=\"226.669437\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g4-171\" y=\"-34.261519\"></use><use x=\"236.945933\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g4-213\" y=\"-59.270229\"></use><use x=\"232.243517\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g13-57\" y=\"-37.193304\"></use><use x=\"235.436244\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g7-50\" y=\"-37.193304\"></use><use x=\"240.207141\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g7-78\" y=\"-37.193304\"></use><use x=\"247.14532\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g7-185\" y=\"-37.193304\"></use><use x=\"249.930768\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g13-56\" y=\"-37.193304\"></use><use x=\"252.916215\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g7-186\" y=\"-37.193304\"></use><use x=\"257.649947\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g16-85\" y=\"-49.075975\"></use><use x=\"263.557797\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g13-56\" y=\"-47.581594\"></use><use x=\"267.125047\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g13-57\" y=\"-47.581594\"></use><use x=\"270.120507\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g16-44\" y=\"-49.075975\"></use><use x=\"279.664705\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g16-17\" y=\"-49.075975\"></use><use x=\"285.93618\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g13-57\" y=\"-47.581594\"></use><use x=\"289.190672\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g4-170\" y=\"-54.625157\"></use><use x=\"289.190672\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g4-174\" y=\"-48.647573\"></use><use x=\"289.190672\" xlink:href=\"#m076_g4-172\" y=\"-34.261519\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">GCN 对邻居使用固定归一化权重，难表达异质关系</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">GCN weighted neighbors solely by static node degrees, preventing the network from prioritizing diagnostically critical neighbors.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以 masked attention 为不同邻居自适应分配权重</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Compute learnable attention scores e_{ij} = a^T [W h_i || W h_j] normalized via softmax over each node's 1-hop neighborhood N_i.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">多头图注意力仍需预定义 adjacency/neighborhood，但不需预设已有边的权重</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Inductive, degree-agnostic anisotropic neighborhood weighting + multi-head stabilization.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">适合血管分支、病人关系和细胞相互作用图</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Widely applied to histopathology cell- microenvironment graphs, brain functional connectivity, and multimodal patient networks.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">重要图模型；attention 权重不自动等于医学解释</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Standard anisotropic GNN; learned attention weights α_{ij} aid inspection but do not guarantee causal biological importance.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">在已有边上为不同邻居学习输入相关权重，替代 GCN 的固定度归一化权重。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">masked attention 仍依赖预先定义的 adjacency；GAT 不会自动发现任意远程边。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">多头机制提高训练稳定性和表示容量，但 attention 权重不是因果或医学解释。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Compute learnable attention scores e_{ij} = a^T [W h_i || W h_j] normalized via softmax over each node's 1-hop neighborhood N_i.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Inductive, degree-agnostic anisotropic neighborhood weighting + multi-head stabilization.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Neighborhood-Masked LeakyReLU Attention Coefficients &amp; Multi-Head Message Aggregation.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适合血管分支、病人关系、组织细胞相互作用等邻居贡献不均的医学图。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">异质边类型、批次效应和构图偏差应显式建模；仅展示高 attention 边不足以证明临床机制。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Widely applied to histopathology cell- microenvironment graphs, brain functional connectivity, and multimodal patient networks.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Standard anisotropic GNN; learned attention weights α_{ij} aid inspection but do not guarantee causal biological importance.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1710.10903\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Graph Attention Networks</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/PetarV-/GAT\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
